&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;平和紙業（香港）有限公司&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;代表取締役社長&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 85px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;河村竜一郎&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 75.8px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;○&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 75.866666666666666666666666667px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 12px"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 85px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;○&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 75.866666666666666666666666667px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;
